        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="nl">geldzakje</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Bags of relatively small to medium size, closed at the mouth by drawing tight a thong or drawstrings (AAT).</skos:scopeNote>
